      "title": "🎯 Block Progress",
      "description": "Shows your best share as a percentage of the current network difficulty. This tells you how close you were to finding a block.\n\n• 100% or higher = You found a block! 🎉\n• Typical values: 0.0001% - 0.01%\n• Formula: (best_share / network_difficulty) × 100\n\nColor guide:\n• Red (0-10%): Just starting\n• Orange (10-50%): Getting closer\n• Yellow (50-90%): Very close!\n• Green (90-100%): Almost there!",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
