      "title": "🎲 Block Chance (30 Days)",
      "description": "Probability of finding at least one block within the next 30 days.\n\n• Calculated using Poisson distribution\n• Formula: 1 - e^(-30days / ETB)\n• Based on your current hashrate\n• Updates automatically with difficulty changes\n\nColor guide:\n• Red (0-5%): Low probability\n• Orange (5-20%): Moderate chance\n• Yellow (20-50%): Good chance\n• Green (50%+): High probability\n\nNote: This assumes constant hashrate and difficulty.",
      "type": "stat"
